# Line endings are part of the provenance contract, not a style choice:
# `para_hash` values and every recorded/pinned `git_blob` id (e.g. the U
# blob in eval/README.md and tests/test_verify_*.py) are byte-exact. A CRLF
# conversion anywhere — a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true, or a parent
# repo's `* text=auto` after the move into MTSAM-docs — changes every blob id
# and para_hash at once and turns all four CI gates red.
#
# All 475 tracked files were verified LF-only when this file was added
# (2026-08-11), so this declaration renormalizes nothing.
* text=auto eol=lf
